#: 13da33b2cbb84802bb7069c6c4626b22
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
